WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.837 --> 00:00:02.860
(audience clapping)

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.760
- Well, I've come with a bit of bad news.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.780
As you know, everyone here
has been tested for COVID.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.160
But unfortunately, some of

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.590
the test results have gotten lost.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.440
So before we go on with the show,

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.610
we just have to do some quick
emergency testing backstage.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:22.600
Don't worry, it's only a few
people, it' totally random.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.840
So when I call your name,

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.630
I'm just gonna need you to come with me.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.803
(audience laughs)

00:00:28.803 --> 00:00:29.636
Now, I've got a list here,

00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:32.200
which I'm looking at, I
have it memorized, but.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.430
If you hear your name,

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.443
I'm gonna start with Bradley Cooper.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.300
Timothy Chalamet, Tyler Perry, Simu Liu.

00:00:47.742 --> 00:00:51.820
And wait, Javier Bardem, oh,
you're still with Penelope.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.033
You know what, actually?

00:00:54.241 --> 00:00:58.130
No, no, no, your test is fine.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.347
It says that you're
married, negative, negative.

00:01:01.347 --> 00:01:04.420
(audience laughs)

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:08.140
Will Smith, you're
married, but you know what?

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:10.530
You're on the list, and it
looks like Jada approved you.

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:13.617
So you get on up here, get on up here.

00:01:21.186 --> 00:01:24.860
All right, now I see we've got
another bad boy on our list.

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:28.250
Let's see, is that Jacob Elordi?

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.210
Is that how you say it, Elordi?

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:34.770
I've seen you on "Euphoria"
and yes, you are legal.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:39.172
I'm sorry, you are positive.

00:01:39.172 --> 00:01:43.680
So you're gonna need a
deep PCR test, now...

00:01:44.636 --> 00:01:46.074
(audience laughs)

00:01:46.074 --> 00:01:48.000
No, no, I don't want any
you all to worry, you know?

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.020
It's gonna be a typical, quick COVID test.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.270
You'll come back stage take your mask off,

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:56.285
if you have one, and your
clothes, and then I'm gonna swab.

00:01:56.285 --> 00:01:57.118
(audience laughs)

00:01:57.118 --> 00:01:58.058
No, it's simple.

00:01:58.058 --> 00:02:00.617
I'm gonna swab the back of your
mouth with my tongue and...

00:02:00.617 --> 00:02:01.660
(audience laughs)

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.410
We're just gonna do
some other freaky stuff,

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.530
which I will record for Academy protocol.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:07.900
Really, this isn't up to me.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:11.364
You know, the truth is,
we're still in a pandemic.

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:13.950
(audience laughs)

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.583
Oh boy, one more name on the list.

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:21.083
So Denzel, Pauletta, is John David here?

00:02:23.185 --> 00:02:24.450
No, no.
(audience laughs)

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:28.140
I'll make a house call, it's
fine, there's no need to worry.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.350
There will be more names.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:33.040
I'll see you guys at the back
in backstage but right now...

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.263
You can go back there,
I'll be waiting for you.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:41.928
Please welcome Jason
Mamoa and Josh Brolin.

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:44.845
(audience cheers)

